get some insight.

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:35.930
And so because NVIDIA
has T4s in the cloud,

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:38.450
I can spin up instances.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:40.620
And, in this
particular workload,

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:43.160
it's a memory-bound
problem to visualize it

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.360
