00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:38.180
But it was really fun.

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:39.290
Something-- a toy.

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:41.520
I have children, but
something I could play with

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:42.690
and it would be amazing.

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.840
So I live in the Great
White North of Minnesota,

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:47.280
where it's snowy all the time.

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:50.840
So I took this out over the last
