00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:18.250
how to rebuild these systems.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.983
I had to go order tools
and replacement parts

00:21:20.983 --> 00:21:21.650
and all of that.

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:24.020
And so, essentially,
three or four weeks later,

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:26.860
I had built an entire tool
bench to manage this gift

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:29.320
that I got for Christmas.

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:32.020
But I got it back up and
running, better than ever,

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:35.440
and it's amazing and
